{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026FturqAXaDu1793316228.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>亞馬遜第三季度業績不如市場預期，股價在延長交易時段曾跌一成二。</p><p></p><p>公司季內純利接近207億美元，按年減少百分之2。每股攤薄盈利1.89美元，較預期少7美仙。淨收入2,019億美元，較預期少近4億美元。當中雲端業務AWS達459.8億美元，略高於預期。廣告收入196.4億美元，則較預期少超過1億美元。</p><p></p><p>預期第四季度經營盈利最多增長三成四，至335億美元。淨收入最高達2,470億美元，增長一成六。至於全年資本開支預測維持在2,200億美元。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T00:20:55.772737+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":219,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T22:31:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T08:58:54.898451+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T00:18:13.762498+00:00","content_hash":"5c9cb3d1c7c4a0db147e714899da3dcaa4cf18b71278b1952f6280d538c8e748","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-30T00:20:55.772737+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}